<title>MEXICO: Tablex Q1 1997 net profit falls.</title>
<headline>Tablex Q1 1997 net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q1 1997			Q1 1996</p>
<p>	Shr		  n.a.			    n.a.</p>
<p>	Oper Income	31.82 million		57.34 million</p>
<p>	Net		  11.26 million		26.61 million</p>
<p>	Revs		 408.56 million	     389.40 million</p>
<p>	Integ fin cost   15.31 million		17.29 million</p>
<p>	  NOTE: All figures in Mexican pesos.</p>
<p>		Full company name is Tablex SA de CV.</p>
<p>((--Dan Trotta, Mexico City newsroom, +525 728-9507))</p>
